    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Twin Angel: Twinkle Paradise",
        "jpn": "快盗天使ツインエンジェル"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Minazuki Haruka and Kannazuki Aoi are two students at St.Cherine academy. Haruka is always filled with bubbly energy while Aoi is more mature and a top student in all her classes - but despite their differences the two are the best of friends. The two girls look like any other girls attending the academy, but the truth is they are hiding a little secret that they can't let anybody know about...",
        "jpn": "都会近郊にありながら、豊かな自然に囲まれた名門『聖チェリーヌ学院』\r\n元気いっぱいだけどちょっとドジなのが玉にキズの水無月遥と、\r\n遥のお姉さん的存在でもあり、成績優秀で生粋のお嬢様な神無月葵。\r\n幼なじみで大の親友のふたりの、誰にも言えない秘密……\r\nそれは、『快盗天使ツインエンジェル』に変身して、悪を戦い\r\n奪われた宝物を取り返すことだったのです！\r\n\r\nLet's Go Fever Time!!\r\nLovely Angel!!\r\n\r\n今、快盗天使たちの、新たなる物語が始まる－－－\r\n「ツインエンジェルに、おまかせだよ♪」"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Kaitō Tenshi Twin Angel",
        "Kaitō Tenshi Twin Angel: Kyun Kyun Tokimeki Paradise!!",
        "Kaitou Tenshi Twin Angel"
    ],
